Package: flyos-search
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Fly OS Project <devnull@example.invalid>
Depends: flyos-core (= @VERSION@), python3
Replaces: flyos-base (<< 0.6.0~)
Breaks: flyos-base (<< 0.6.0~)
Description: Fly OS local-first search and indexing
 Provides the private per-user filename index and command-line search service used
 by Fly Shell. File contents are never indexed and no query leaves the computer.
